Maguro line-icon catalog
=========================

The toolbar icon catalog redraws shapes from IconMCP (https://iconmcp.com)
with Maguro's own line-icon pen (17-unit box, stroke 1.35, round caps, theme
ink). The SVG files were a shape reference only. They are not embedded in the
executable, and Maguro does not render SVG at runtime.

